# Deploy monitoring

Read [development processes](../../docs/engineering-policy.md#development-processes).

Do not poll Render (or other host) deploy status, wait for live, watch build logs, or
list recent deploys unless the user explicitly asks. Pushing or triggering a deploy when
requested is fine; monitoring afterward is not.
